          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सज्जन (sajjan) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit saj-jana, \"a good or virtuous man\", built on sat, \"good\", and jana, \"person\" (Monier-Williams). It is the polite word for a man one does not know."
